  "result": "Quiz 0002 is ready: six items on O4, in `quizzes/0002.json`. Its key is `keys/0002.json`.\n\nThe quiz is ahead of the lessons, because no lesson on workflows versus agents exists yet. It is a check of the objective itself, and I wrote it from my own knowledge without searching for a source. I answered each item from its stem alone before finishing, and each has one defensible answer. I haven't run any check on the files.\n\nItems are set in the makerspace assistant. They cover:\n- who owns the control flow\n- classifying a design where the model labels a message and the code then branches\n- which assistant task suits a fixed workflow\n- why a workflow is the better choice when the steps never change\n- a hybrid design that mixes workflow and agent\n- a cost calculation that shows what an agent's extra model calls add\n\nThe key introduces three new misconception ids: M7, that the difference is tools, size or step count; M8, that a workflow uses no model; and M9, that an agent is the better design everywhere. `NOTES.md` is unchanged.\n\nDo you want a short lesson on workflows versus agents before Riley takes it, or should they try the quiz first?",
